    "title": "Scenario 3 - Microservices Healthcare Application",
    "owner": "Asadullah",
    "description": "A healthcare organisation microservices-based patient management system comprising a Patient Portal, Identity Service, Medical Records Service, Appointment Service, Notification Service, and API Gateway. The patient portal and API gateway are exposed to the public internet.",
    "id": 2
  },
